Q: Java Optional check for object and its property A: <p>This is probably what you want</p>
<pre><code>Optional.ofNullable(emp).map(Employee::getName).ifPresent(System.out::println);
</code></pre>

Q: Use LINQ to move item to top of list A: <p>Even easier if you have the object:</p>
<pre><code>listOfObjects.Remove(object);
listOfObjects.Insert(0, object);
</code></pre>
